                                            "Having a glaring expression suggesting madness or terror."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fe5c1e89-1798-4374-8897-fb39468a5deb",
                                                "sense_id": "63c189f7-77bb-3b72-99b0-501c8db27025",
                                                "text": "“Wild-eyed and disheveled, King Hrethel roamed every night through his throne room, which was empty and still.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "edaf02e9-ec8c-4b02-ad33-31595aa49998",
                                                "sense_id": "63c189f7-77bb-3b72-99b0-501c8db27025",
                                                "text": "A better study it seems to me could be about why some heteros are so wild-eyed obsessed with us, their hate, the kind of leaders they choose to follow in their greed and prejudice, and their need for someone to persecute."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a582acfd-882f-4357-925f-d263ffd1072b",
                                                "sense_id": "63c189f7-77bb-3b72-99b0-501c8db27025",
                                                "text": "In the mirror a wild-eyed, peroxided stranger who had clearly gone insane stared back at me."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
